  "issue": {
    "body": "Both Starlette & Uvicorn have recently updated their licenses. ([ref](https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3025), [ref](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/2699))\n\nRather than *asking the license holder for consent*, Marcelo checked in [with ChatGPT](https://bsky.app/profile/marcelotryle.bsky.social/post/3lypucjyakc2x).\n\nI've requested the change be reverted: As the license holder, changes there require my consent.\n\n*There's some related discussions worth having around community positioning for `uvicorn` and `starlette`, though I'd like to start on a clear footing by reverting the licensing changes & ensuring that authorship and maintainership is [correctly](https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/pull/3033/files) [attributed](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/2719/files).*",
    "closed_at": "2026-02-04T08:53:30Z",
    "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:01:00Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/3042",
